Feature Name
"Main Ticket Service - Built one main service that handles all support ticket requests."
"Full Ticket Lifecycle - It can log a query, create a ticket, update it, resolve it, and close it."
"Auto Query-to-Ticket - If an issue isn't solved, it automatically turns it into a support ticket."
"Reusable Framework - Built in a reusable way, so new systems can be added easily later."
"One Conversation = One Ticket - One conversation always stays linked to one ticket, no mix-ups."
"ServiceNow-Ready Integration - Ready to connect to the real ServiceNow system whenever access is given."
"Standard Ticket Format - Uses a fixed, clean format so ticket details are always consistent."
"End-to-End Testing - Fully tested end-to-end with sample data until the live system is ready."

